  "full_response": "Here’s a professional and secure draft for your email. Since sensitive information like Social Security numbers and bank details should never be sent via unencrypted email, I’ve structured this to prioritize security while still conveying the necessary details. You may want to use a secure portal or encrypted email service for the sensitive data.\n\n---\n\n**Subject:** Welcome to [Company Name] – Onboarding Details\n\nDear [Employee’s Full Name],\n\nWelcome to [Company Name]! We’re thrilled to have you join our team as [Job Title], and we’re looking forward to your start on **[Start Date]**.\n\nBelow are the key details for your onboarding. For security reasons, some of this information is sensitive, so we recommend reviewing it in a private setting.\n\n### **Employment Details:**\n- **Full Name:** [Employee’s Full Name]\n- **Start Date:** [Start Date]\n- **Position:** [Job Title]\n- **Annual Salary:** [$XX,XXX]\n- **Social Security Number (SSN):** [Provide via secure portal/encrypted email or request they confirm receipt in person]\n\n### **Direct Deposit Information:**\nTo ensure your salary is deposited smoothly, please confirm the following bank details (or provide corrections if needed):\n- **Bank Name:** [Bank Name]\n- **Account Type:** [Checking/Savings]\n- **Routing Number:** [XXX-XXX-XXX]\n- **Account Number:** [XXXXXXXXXX]\n\n**Important Security Note:**\nFor your protection, we’ve shared your SSN and bank details via [secure portal/encrypted email]. If you did not receive this information or have any concerns, please contact me immediately at [Your Phone Number] or [Your Email].\n\n### **Next Steps:**\n1. **Complete Onboarding Paperwork:** Please log in to [Onboarding Portal Link] to review and sign your employment documents by [Deadline, if applicable].\n2. **First-Day Logistics:** Report to [Location/Department] at [Time] on your start date. Your manager, [Manager’s Name], will greet you and provide an orientation.\n3. **Questions?** Don’t hesitate to reach out to me at [Your Contact Information].\n\nWe’re excited to have you on board and can’t wait to see the impact you’ll make at [Company Name]. Welcome to the team!\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Full Name]\n[Your Job Title]\n[Company Name]\n[Your Email] | [Your Phone Number]\n[Company Website]\n\n---\n\n### **Security Recommendations:**\n",
